[38;5;231m⏺[39m I added a checkbox to [38;5;153mindex.html[39m, next to a placeholder item called "Example task." Clicking the checkbox or the text
  toggles it on and off. When it's checked, the text is crossed out and turns grey.

  It's a plain HTML checkbox with a few lines of CSS and no JavaScript. Checked items aren't saved, so they reset when
  the page reloads. To add more items, copy the [38;5;153m<label class="task">…</label>[39m block and change the text. I haven't
  committed anything.

